  "changes": [
    "Invoice/catalog/recurring draft/manual webhook retry persist opaque original key and input digest before dispatch. Journal is scoped by account, selected merchant and operation through a hashed namespace.",
    "An unknown result survives page reload, logout and new authenticated session. Changed inputs cannot issue a replacement request; restoring original inputs retries the exact original key.",
    "Web Locks serialize admission and bounded dispatch; synchronous approved SDK hashing preserves the pre-await observed intent, so a waiting old attempt cannot create a replacement after confirmation.",
    "Original request contents are copied in memory before any await. Late account or merchant changes cannot adopt the result or clear its original journal.",
    "Successful bounded API response clears only its original key; cleanup failure preserves recovery. Private drafts still clear at logout and are never written to the journal.",
    "Browser tests now run on the registered HTTPS merchant origin intercepted to owned dist, with valid SDK provider announcements and the existing original /merchant/ asset base."
  ],
